        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-11-14T19:13:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think&nbsp;your rewording and what Shadowstripe has argued&nbsp;is likely the intent that the defend is meant to be against the attack. &nbsp;However, based off what wording we have currently the Defend action is not tied to being used against the incoming attack damage. &nbsp;Hopefully based off comments on the KS and messages sent to the Letters Page we can get a ruling on what is supposed to happen. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:50.549Z",
