        "id": 229162,
        "name": "TempestLA",
        "username": "TempestLA",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-11-14T20:28:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Although not specifically tied to the incoming damage by the wording of the ability, it is tied to the damage by the game effect of Defend, which states the defend is applied to the next damage taken. Since the next damage taken is the potential damage that triggers the ability in the first place, it is applied to that damage.</p>",
