      {
        "id": 229173,
        "name": "catDreaming",
        "username": "catDreaming",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-12-03T23:30:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm satisfied with the official change to Defensive Deflection. It's fewer words, simpler to implement, and still accomplishes the same general flavor.</p>\n<p>Besides, is it not comic book-like for some guy to completely absorb a blast of energy, before unleashing it back at a significantly increased power?</p>",
