      {
        "id": 229174,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-12-04T02:26:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just for other people this is the updated text of Defensive Deflection</p>\n<p>\n&gt; <br>\n&gt; When you would be dealt damage, you may roll your single [power] die as a Defend against that damage and as an Attack&nbsp;against a nearby target other than the source of that damage.</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>\n</p>",
